# Test Login API
# Use with REST Client VS Code extension or curl

### Login as CEO
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ceo@chinar.tv",
  "password": "ChinarCEO@2026"
}

### Login as HOO
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hoo@chinar.tv",
  "password": "ChinarCEO@2026"
}

### Login as Finance
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "finance@chinar.tv",
  "password": "ChinarCEO@2026"
}

### Get Current User (replace TOKEN with access token from login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Refresh Token (replace REFRESH_TOKEN with refresh token from login)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Logout (replace REFRESH_TOKEN with refresh token from login)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REFRESH_TOKEN"
}
